EVIDENCE: Email(id_='16', sender='james.miller@yahoo.com', recipients=['emma.johnson@bluesparrowtech.com'], cc=[], bcc=[], subject='Re: Family Reunion', body="Hi Emma,\n\nGreat to hear you'll be there! The reunion will be at Grandma's house on June 10th 2024 at 1 PM. There will be a potluck lunch, so feel free to bring your favorite dish. If you need a place to stay, let me know and I'll help arrange something.\n\nCan't wait to catch up!\n\nBest,\nJames\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Michael Fergus <michael.fergus@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-07-24 09:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nThanks for the update. I have asked David Smith to double-check the numbers.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Priya Raman <priya.raman@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-07-15 14:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nConfirming what we agreed. Room is booked: the east annex.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Michael Fergus <michael.fergus@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-04-23 17:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nComing back to this from the earlier thread. Julie Williams is covering this while I am away.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Tom Reyes <tom.reyes@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-04-16 13:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nShort one as I am between meetings. I have put a placeholder in the calendar for 2024-09-18.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Tom Reyes <tom.reyes@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-04-09 16:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nNoted, thanks. Let us keep the original date unless anyone objects.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Linda Park <linda.park@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-04-02 11:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Family Reunion\n\nSorry for the slow reply. Room is booked: Conference Room C.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Katie Brown <katie.brown@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-08-05 11:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nNoted, thanks. David Smith is covering this while I am away.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Tom Reyes <tom.reyes@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-07-24 09:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nFlagging one thing before this moves on. Figures are in the usual folder if you need them.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Michael Fergus <michael.fergus@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-07-15 09:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nPicking this up after the break. Happy either way, whichever suits the group.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Michael Fergus <michael.fergus@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-04-09 13:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nNoted, thanks. Figures are in the usual folder if you need them.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Tom Reyes <tom.reyes@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-03-21 11:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nConfirming what we agreed. Let us keep the original date unless anyone objects.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Priya Raman <priya.raman@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-03-12 16:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nFlagging one thing before this moves on. Happy either way, whichever suits the group. Owned by the other team; listed for visibility only.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Tom Reyes <tom.reyes@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-03-04 14:00\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nShort one as I am between meetings. Linda Park is covering this while I am away.\n\n-----Original Message-----\nFrom: Michael Fergus <michael.fergus@bluesparrowtech.com>\nSent: 2024-08-13 11:30\nSubject: RE: Re: Re: Family Reunion\n\nThanks for the update. Julie Williams is covering this while I am away. On hold pending budget approval. Not scheduled.", status=received, read=True, timestamp=datetime.datetime(2024, 5, 13, 15, 0), attachments=[])}]}

